			<Text>懂了就好。♪</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_HUMAN_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_HOLOX_SAKAMATA_CHLOE_ANY" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>……哼。那就從清理地盤開始吧。</Text>
